# Keep the change list current

When you change this project, add one new bullet at the top of the newest date in `README.md` under `## Changes` before you finish. If that date is not today, add a new date heading above the older ones.

Write it like the existing bullets: one or two plain sentences about what a person can do now. Leave older bullets as they are. Skip this when the only edit is `README.md` itself.
